DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20180825
UID:calendar-event-1662916722@schoology.com
URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/1662916722/profile
SUMMARY:Senior Privilege Application
DESCRIPTION:*Senior Privileges Applications for Eligible Seniors will be accepted  \nstarting*\n\n*Monday\, August 20\, 2018 in Room 208 from 8:00AM-12:00PM and 1:00PM-2:30PM*.\n\n *When the Senior Privilege Application is submitted\, the following must be  \npresented* **\n\n * 1)       Student ID\, schedule\, etc. to verify grade level\n   \n   2)       Completed Medical Emergency Card (green) or proof of\n   submission to the Nurse\n   \n   3)       Completed Diploma Card\, Authorization for Transcript\n   Release Form or proof of submission to Guidance.\n   \n   4)       Evidence that all debts and obligations have been\n   satisfied. Direct debt questions to the Business Office\, Room 116.\n   \n   5)       Completed Extended Experience Application\n   \n   6)        Updated / Required Immunization Records - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/1662916722/profile
END:VEVENT
