SUMMARY:Harvard MUN Conference
DESCRIPTION:-------- THURSDAY\, JANUARY 28 ------------------------------------------------\n\n12:00 pm - 4:00pm Registration\n\n4:00 pm - 4:30pm Mandatory Faculty Advisor and Head Delegate Welcome\n\n5:00pm - 6:00pm Opening Ceremonies\n\n6:00pm - 9:00pm Committee Session I\n\n8:30pm - 9:00pm Faculty Advisor Meet-and-Greet with the Secretariat\n\n \n\n-------- FRIDAY\, JANUARY 29 --------------------------------------------------\n\n4:00pm - 5:00pm Head Delegate Feedback Session\n\n4:00pm - 5:00pm Get to Know the Youth Activism Project\n\n5:00pm - 7:00pm Committee Session II\n\n7:00pm - 8:00pm Faculty Advisor Feedback Session\n\n7:00pm - 8:00pm Mandatory Delegate Break\n\n8:00pm - 9:00pm Writing Session I\n\n9:00pm - 10:00pm Committee Session III\n\n10:00pm - 11:00pm Delegate Social\n\n \n\n-------- SATURDAY\, JANUARY 30 ------------------------------------------------\n\n5:00pm - 7:00pm Committee Session IV\n\n7:00pm - 8:00pm Faculty Advisor Feedback Session\n\n7:00pm - 7:30pm Mandatory Delegate Break\n\n7:30pm - 8:00pm Writing Session II\n\n8:00pm - 9:00 pm Committee Session V\n\n9:30pm - 10:30pm Cultural Extravaganza\n\n \n\n-------- SUNDAY\, JANUARY 31 --------------------------------------------------\n\n5:00pm - 8:00pm Committee Session VI\n\n8:30pm - 10:00pm Closing Ceremonies - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/3338442570/profile
END:VEVENT
