UID:calendar-event-7504882877@schoology.com
URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/event/7504882877/profile
SUMMARY:Reading Olympics Interest Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Let's Dive into the World of Stories!\n\n Attention\, all students with a passion for reading! We're thrilled to  \nannounce the first Reading Olympics meeting will be at Tredyffrin Easttown  \nMiddle School on the following date/time:\n\n**Date:** First Meeting on Monday\, October 7\n\n**Time:** 3:15PM to 4:00PM\n\n**Location:** Library\n\nAre you curious about new books\, eager to discuss your favorite stories\, or  \nlooking for a supportive group of fellow readers? The Reading Olympics Club  \nis here to make your reading journey even more exciting.\n\n \n\n**What's in Store:**\n\n- Fun book-related games and activities.\n\n- Friendly book debates and discussions.\n\n- A chance to build lasting friendships with fellow bookworms.\n\n \n\nMark your calendar for October 9 and join us for our interest meeting. Let's  \ndive into the wonderful world of stories together!\n\n Please pick up a permission slip from Ms. Romani's room and turn it in to  \nher before October 7th.  You can also find this year's reading list below!\n\nIf you have any questions or need more information\, please get in touch with  \nMs. Romani or comment on this post. We can't wait to dive into the adventure  \nof reading! - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/event/7504882877/profile
END:VEVENT
