URL;VALUE=URI:http://schoology.tesd.net/assignment/8574186803
SUMMARY:Chapter 9 Reading
DESCRIPTION:QUESTIONS \n\n \n\n 1) How do the beliefs and practices of Islam reflect interactions among the\n    people of the Arabian peninsula?\n\n \n\n 1) How did the development of Islam change gender roles in Bedouin society?\n\n \n\n 1) How did the caliphate develop  after the death of Muhammad? \n\n \n\n 1) How did the Abbasid caliphate blend different cultural traditions? \n\n \n\n 1) How did the expansion of the caliphate contribute to the spread of new\n    technologies and scientific knowledge? \n\n \n\n 1) How did Islamic beliefs and practices support commerce and the merchant\n    class? \n\n \n\n 1) Describe slavery in the Abbasid caliphate.  \n\n \n\n 1) How did the role of Baghdad change as the power of Abbasid rulers\n    waned? \n\n \n\n 1) What new forms of governance emerged in the Islamic world following the\n    collapse of the Abbasid caliphate?  - Link: http://schoology.tesd.net/assignment/8574186803
END:VEVENT
